<http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/lu_3756890c1e5fc6e4f303d0d69c5e6674192365d99b5559676ac7dc7c72e24ed8_n0016/na_0033> <http://digistrucmed.org/relationConfidence> "0.96"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_3756890c1e5fc6e4f303d0d69c5e6674192365d99b5559676ac7dc7c72e24ed8_n0016/tu_0003> <http://digistrucmed.org/hasExtractedEntity> <http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_3756890c1e5fc6e4f303d0d69c5e6674192365d99b5559676ac7dc7c72e24ed8_n0016/e_0028> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_3756890c1e5fc6e4f303d0d69c5e6674192365d99b5559676ac7dc7c72e24ed8_n0016/e_0007/normalization> <http://digistrucmed.org/normalizationMappingMethod> "NONE" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/lu_3756890c1e5fc6e4f303d0d69c5e6674192365d99b5559676ac7dc7c72e24ed8_n0016/na_0002> <http://digistrucmed.org/recommendationStatus> "PRESENT" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_3756890c1e5fc6e4f303d0d69c5e6674192365d99b5559676ac7dc7c72e24ed8_n0016/tu_0006> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The initial dose of diuretic may be increased as necessary to relieve congestion. Restoration of normal volume status may require multiple adjustments over many days and occasionally weeks in patients with severe fluid overload evidenced by massive edema or ascites. After a diuretic effect is achieved with short-acting loop diuretics, increasing administration frequency to twice or even 3 times per day will provide more diuresis with less physiologic perturbation than larger single doses. (Strength of Evidence = B) Oral torsemide may be considered in patients in whom poor absorption of oral medication or erratic diuretic effect may be present, particularly those with right-sided HF and refractory fluid retention despite high doses of other loop diuretics. (Strength of Evidence = C) Intravenous administration of diuretics may be necessary to relieve congestion. (Strength of Evidence = A) Diuretic refractoriness may represent patient nonadherence, a direct effect of diuretic use on the kidney, or progression of underlying cardiac dysfunction." .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_3756890c1e5fc6e4f303d0d69c5e6674192365d99b5559676ac7dc7c72e24ed8_n0016/e_0026/normalization> <http://digistrucmed.org/normalizationMappingStatus> "UNMAPPED" .
