<http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/lu_3756890c1e5fc6e4f303d0d69c5e6674192365d99b5559676ac7dc7c72e24ed8_n0016/na_0033> <http://digistrucmed.org/applicabilityExceptionStatus> "NONE_STATED" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity/short%20acting%20loop%20diuretics> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "short acting loop diuretics" .
